Node ID=300 the dead let you walk
Text=<His sword is up before you are close.> Stand there. I watched you come up through that gallery, and not one of them lifted a hand to you. I have held this line for two hundred years and I have never once seen that. What are you, and what did they promise you? Answer carefully. If I call this line to arms, the Lady will hear it.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Speech moreequal 100
Reply Text=<Lie> They took me for one of their own. I let them.
Go to node ID=302 fools

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Their master wants to bargain. I have not answered him.
Go to node ID=301 an envoy
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt garrison takes up arms
}

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I owe them nothing, and I owe you less.
Go to node ID=303 they do not part
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt garrison takes up arms
}

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will go.
Go to node ID=304 go then
Is Default Reply=1

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=301 an envoy
Text=Then you are his envoy until you have, and his envoys do not stand in this line. <He raises his voice.> To arms! The dead have sent us a guest!
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=302 fools
Text=<He does not lower the sword.> Then they are fools, or you are. Stay where I can see you, and keep away from the Lady.
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=303 they do not part
Text=<His eyes go to the dead behind you, and back to you.> They do not part for nothing. To arms!
Should Have Voiceover=0

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=304 go then
Text=Go, then. And do not come back to this line while they are still letting you walk.
Should Have Voiceover=0

